      "content": "idk i feel like i should probably see a doctor but honestly i just dont have the time or the money for appointments right now. its probably nothing major right? if i just try to sleep more and take some magnesium or vitamins i can just wait it out? i dont want to make a huge deal out of it if its just stress.",
