      "content": "i hear you but it feels like a lot of doctors just tell you its anxiety anyway lol. i really just want to know if there is anything i can take right now to help with the confusion so it doesnt happen as much while i'm working. like is there a specific dose of magnesium or maybe some other supplement that's really good for clearing up brain fog quickly? i just want to fix it at home.",
